<pending_commit branch="master" change_id="Icf745b8bcfaa98d827051c93aaa16a525d1f3846" commit="da581f733c093e2b67a48a6cbfd8aad1087cb810" commit_message="CRAS: alsa_ucm - Add method to query main volume names  Add method to query main volume control names specified in UCM by MainVolumeNames separated by comma. These are the mixer controls that affect all output on this card, e.g. speaker and headphone.  BUG=chromium:540888 TEST=make check  Signed-off-by: Cheng-Yi Chiang &lt;cychiang@chromium.org&gt; Change-Id: Icf745b8bcfaa98d827051c93aaa16a525d1f3846 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/322347 Reviewed-by: Dylan Reid &lt;dgreid@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="322347" owner_email="cychiang@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="6" project="chromiumos/third_party/adhd" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/adhd" ref="refs/changes/47/322347/6" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I1115ec6dc344a41554e152a8f97b159ad1a10a32" commit="81f8d5b803b755146927cad0dbdf7e65e63d6b3f" commit_message="CRAS: alsa_ucm - Let get_sections_for_var returns a list  Previously we use get_section_for_var to find one section whose variable is the target value. Now we want to search for multiple sections because there can be multiple sections with the same &quot;PlaybackPCM&quot; or &quot;CapturePCM&quot; value, representing the nodes on that device when mandatory UCM is used.  This change let get_sections_for_var returns a list of section_names. The user of this static function needs to handle the returned list: - ucm_get_dev_for_mixer only cares if such section exist, so return any section found. - ucm_get_dev_for_jack tries to find the section that has a matched jack   name. It should handle the logic of section name &quot;Mic&quot; in the   function, so move the check of direction out of get_sections_for_var.  Also, add unittest for ucm_get_dev_for_mixer and ucm_get_dev_for_mixer, and add check for get_sections_for_var.  The next change will use get_sections_for_var to find the sections for certain PCM device.  BUG=chromium:540888 TEST=unittest  Signed-off-by: Cheng-Yi Chiang &lt;cychiang@chromium.org&gt; Change-Id: I1115ec6dc344a41554e152a8f97b159ad1a10a32 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/322672 Reviewed-by: Dylan Reid &lt;dgreid@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="322672" owner_email="cychiang@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="4" project="chromiumos/third_party/adhd" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/adhd" ref="refs/changes/72/322672/4" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I6540ca0b379da4c832f015f49c7645853ace11de" commit="b013b94a791c2965981bb9e93ad09da2eac46405" commit_message="CRAS: alsa_ucm - Simplify snd_use_case_get in unittest  Remove snd_use_case_get_ret_value stub value. The return value is 0 if the identifier can be found, and -1 otherwise.  BUG=chromium:540888 TEST=make check  Signed-off-by: Cheng-Yi Chiang &lt;cychiang@chromium.org&gt; Change-Id: I6540ca0b379da4c832f015f49c7645853ace11de Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/322872 Reviewed-by: Dylan Reid &lt;dgreid@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="322872" owner_email="cychiang@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="3" project="chromiumos/third_party/adhd" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/adhd" ref="refs/changes/72/322872/3" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I052d742757a3826716e15bbf23fdb1c59760d4e4" commit="6ca19e038819a70d8f7a9885650129df85822fc0" commit_message="CRAS: alsa_ucm - Add function to list section devices  Add ucm_list_section_devices_by_device_name so user can list section devices whose &quot;CapturePCM&quot; or &quot;PlaybackPCM&quot; match specified device name.  BUG=chromium:540888 TEST=make check  Signed-o